# The root .gitignore ignores results/ globally for run artifacts, then un-ignores this
# subtree (!benchmark/results/) so git descends here and reads THIS file. The benchmark's
# published results ARE the deliverable, but transient run scratch is not — so ignore
# everything by default and whitelist only the manifest, per-run JSON, comparison, and
# this file. Keeps stray artifacts (adapters/scratch) out while tracking the deliverables.
*
!*.json
!*.md
!.gitignore
